most interesting in years. The only reason I've not contributed is that I
always agree with jorge and he says all that needs to be said. Anyway, I
wanted to point out that the moribund jboske list at yahoogroups remains
available, along with its valuable archive. I set it so that new members
have to be manually approved, so as to prevent spam, but I could add further
moderators.

And.

